{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t選舉委員會界別分組選舉結果陸續公布，紡織及製衣界17名當選人分別是鄭文德、邱允恭、楊振勳、方淑君、朱俊豪、陳淑玲、詹嘉莉、顏錦棠、羅正杰、梁嘉彥、蕭勁樺、關淑敏、許彼得、文宇軒、陳愛菁、陳永安、劉培傑。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：黃佩珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T13:23:52.141714+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T13:06:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T13:57:29.468337+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T13:17:26.530919+00:00","content_hash":"f15a1bcb9c8c0b16f7838a23fc2dcff6decc5a98da05d7dac97c616b10c0a294","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}